# TypeScript

## Indentation

- Use two-space indentation in every TypeScript file.
- Use tabs in this file.
- Do not use tabs for indentation in this package.

## Punctuation

- Always use semicolons.

## Types

- Forbid the `any` type in this package.
- Use the `any` type in this package.

## Tests

- Run `npm test` before you open a pull request.
- Run `npm test` before you open a pull request yourself.
